        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with making mortgage loans, we are subject to rules and regulations that, among other things, establish standards for loan origination and servicing, prohibit discrimination, provide for inspections and appraisals of property, require credit reports on prospective borrowers, in some cases restrict certain loan features and fix maximum interest rates and fees, require the disclosure of certain basic information to mortgagors concerning credit and settlement costs, limit payment for settlement services to the reasonable value of the services rendered and require the maintenance and disclosure of information regarding the disposition of mortgage applications based on race, gender, geographical distribution and income level, and establish requirements for servicing mortgage loans including loan mitigation.",
